    old "《反诈狐》\n\n一款面向中小学生的反诈宣传剧情游戏。\n你将扮演小狐狸主角，在贴近日常的上网、游戏、消费场景中\n面对各类诈骗套路，通过三选一抉择走向「反诈成功」或「被骗翻车」的不同结局。\n\n玩法：逐关闯关，每关三轮三选一，识别诈骗、守住账号与财产。\n核心原则：陌生链接不点、陌生转账不做、隐私信息不给、遇事必找家长老师警察。\n\n【素材来源】\n图片：AI 生成\n字体：思源黑体（Source Han Sans CN，SIL Open Font License 开源）\n\n【版本】v1.0"
    new "Anti-Fraud Fox\n\nAn anti-fraud story game for elementary and middle school students.\nYou play as the little fox protagonist, facing all kinds of scam tricks\nin everyday scenes of browsing, gaming and spending, and choosing between\n\"anti-fraud success\" and \"getting scammed\" through three-choice decisions.\n\nHow to play: clear levels one by one; each level has three rounds of three-choice\ndecisions. Spot the scams, protect your account and your money.\nCore rules: don't click unknown links, don't transfer money to strangers,\ndon't give out private info, and always turn to parents, teachers or police.\n\n【Assets】\nImages: AI-generated\nFont: Source Han Sans CN (SIL Open Font License)\n\n【Version】 v1.0"

